sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as OGX Operator<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Pod as OGX Server Pod<br/>8321/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,Pod: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply OGXServer CR<br/>(ogx.io/v1beta1)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: AdmissionReview (POST)<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed / Denied<br/>(validates distribution, provider IDs, model refs)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created/rejected

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: OGXServer<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA Token
    Operator->>OCI: Fetch image labels<br/>HTTPS/443, Anonymous
    OCI-->>Operator: Base config.yaml from labels
    Operator->>Operator: Merge user providers onto base config<br/>Resolve secrets → env vars
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update resources<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA Token
    Note right of K8sAPI: Deployment, Service, NetworkPolicy,<br/>HPA, PDB, PVC, ServiceMonitor,<br/>PrometheusRule, Ingress (optional)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources created
    Operator->>Pod: Health check GET /v1/providers<br/>HTTP, configurable port
    Pod-->>Operator: Provider status
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA Token

    Note over User,Pod: Flow 2: OGX Module Platform Integration
    participant PlatOp as Platform Operator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant Module as OGX Module<br/>8080/TCP metrics

    PlatOp->>K8sAPI: Create OGX CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI->>Module: Watch event: OGX CR<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA Token
    Module->>Module: Render kustomize overlays<br/>(RHOAI / ODH)
    Module->>K8sAPI: Deploy OGX Operator resources<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA Token
    Module->>K8sAPI: List OGXServer CRs<br/>(health aggregation)
    Module->>K8sAPI: Update OGX CR status<br/>(Ready/Degraded)

    Note over User,Pod: Flow 3: User Request to OGX Server
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Ingress Controller<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant ExtAPI as External Provider<br/>(vLLM, OpenAI, etc.)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Client->>Ingress: HTTP request<br/>Port 80 (TLS depends on controller)
    Ingress->>Pod: Forward to Service<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    Pod->>ExtAPI: Inference request<br/>HTTPS/443, API Key / Bearer Token
    ExtAPI-->>Pod: Inference response
    Pod-->>Ingress: Response
    Ingress-->>Client: Response
